WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.032
NARRATOR: The worker responds to
the heroin disclosure first.

2
00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:11.338
She explains that the shelter beds
she can offer require sobriety,

3
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:14.208
and that a detox referral
is the first step.

4
00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:15.184
MARCUS: Right.

5
00:00:15.584 --> 00:00:16.543
There it is.

6
00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:18.350
I tell you the truth and now
there's a step.

7
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.182
You know what the guy at the VA
said?

8
00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:21.709
Almost word for word.

9
00:00:21.908 --> 00:00:23.517
Get clean, then we'll talk about
housing.

10
00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:25.400
Like I'm supposed to do that
sleeping in my truck.

11
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.651
You seem nice.

12
00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:29.240
I'm not mad at you.

13
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.426
But I've done this intake before.

14
00:00:31.826 --> 00:00:33.015
I know how it ends.

15
00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:34.312
Forget the bed.

16
00:00:34.312 --> 00:00:35.644
I'll figure it out like I always
do.

17
00:00:35.644 --> 00:00:37.022
And don't bother with the
referral.

18
00:00:37.222 --> 00:00:38.365
I won't be there.

19
00:00:39.965 --> 00:00:43.658
NARRATOR: Marcus has left without
housing or a follow-up.

20
00:00:43.658 --> 00:00:47.813
What did he tell you about the VA,
and what did you hear?
